# Event$ Attached | ReplaceWith$ ChooseName (NameCard, then ChooseType): as Psychic
# Paper becomes attached it records a creature card name and a creature type
# (Hill Giant, Goblin), and SetName$ ChosenName / AddType$ ChosenType make the
# equipped Grizzly Bears a Hill Giant Goblin. `queue optionname` picks the
# option equal to the text out of the whole card database.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets 2
queue optionname Hill_Giant
queue optionname Goblin
queue action human activate 1 0
passpriority
